Design, develop, troubleshoot and/or test/QA software. Define analytical approaches to solving challenging retail business problems in close collaboration with product management and solution architects. Develop and validate prototypes; test proposed solutions on real data. Write algorithmic specifications for forecasting, optimization, and data mining engines. Assist Development and QA with implementation and testing of new functionality. Assist with initial customer deployments of new functionality or new products. Present findings to internal and external audiences. Define and develop software for tasks associated with the developing, debugging or designing of software applications or operating systems. Provide technical leadership to other software developers. Specify, design and implement modest changes to existing software architecture to meet changing needs. Create patents and research new solutions for solving business problems

skills
