EducationBachelor's DegreeSkillsSQLCIGitHadoopAWSYour tasks and responsibilities
The primary responsibilities of this role, Data Platform Engineer, are to:

Please note - Role can be based in our St. Louis location OR remotely in the United States.
As part of Bayer’s Data Platform team, design, develop, and support enterprise Data Historian Platform (Data Lake);
Extend and optimize the Data Historian platform. Future planned enhancement work includes development of a better monitoring console for the platform, improving the ingestion work flow into the system, and completing the data governance work flow;
