1-2 years of related work experience, healthcare experience preferred;
Proficiency with MS Excel, and other standard office applications;
Experience with quantitative or statistical analysis of program data, and use of analysis and visualization software, Tableau, SAS, R preferred;
Ability to manage multiple complex projects with tight deadlines at one time;
Strong organizational skills;
Demonstrates strong verbal and written communication skills;
Detail-oriented, fast learner and flexible;
Experience or familiarity with Meaningful Use reporting, Clinical Quality reporting, Medicare and Medicaid claims data, ICD, CDA, and other healthcare related data and data structures, is a plus;
Familiarity with relational database software (such as MS SQL Server or MYSQL), is a plus;
Salesforce Enterprise administration and reporting experience, is a plus;

